From a15a15597ebfe281d9a317675f6fd02e7ae5f974 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agranlund <granlund23@yahoo.se>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 22:54:48 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] BACKENDS: ATARI: Add minimal two-thread preemptive
 context switcher

A 200 Hz TimerC-driven scheduler with two usermode threads, trap #4
yield and a recursive spin-yield mutex.
---
 backends/platform/atari/module.mk |   1 +
 backends/platform/atari/thread.S  | 288 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 backends/platform/atari/thread.h  |  48 +++++
 3 files changed, 337 insertions(+)
